### PetHaven — Colección de verificación de peticiones HTTP

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@ownerId = 1

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### REST · /api/owners
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar dueños → 200 [OwnerResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/owners
Accept: application/json

### Detalle de dueño → 200 OwnerResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/owners/{{ownerId}}
Accept: application/json

### Detalle inexistente → 404 ApiErrorResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/owners/99999
Accept: application/json

### Crear dueño → 201 + cabecera Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/owners
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "990000001",
  "name": "Dueño de Prueba",
  "email": "dueno.prueba@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "3000000000"
}

### Crear duplicado (mismo documento) → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/owners
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "990000001",
  "name": "Otro Dueño",
  "email": "otro.prueba@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "3000000001"
}

### Crear inválido (campos vacíos, correo malo, password corta) → 400 + errors{}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/owners
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "",
  "name": "",
  "email": "no-es-un-correo",
  "password": "123",
  "phone": ""
}

### Actualizar sin password (se conserva) → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/owners/{{ownerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "123456789",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "phone": "3001234567"
}

### Actualizar con password corta → 400
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/owners/{{ownerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "123456789",
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "123",
  "phone": "3001234567"
}

### Eliminar dueño → 204 (o 409 si alguna mascota tiene tratamientos)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/owners/{{ownerId}}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### REST · /api/pets
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar mascotas → 200 [PetResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Accept: application/json

### Buscar por nombre (substring, sin distinguir mayúsculas) → 200 [PetResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets?search=bud
Accept: application/json

### Detalle de mascota → 200 PetResponse
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear mascota → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Firulais de Prueba",
  "ownerId": 1,
  "species": "DOG",
  "breed": "Mestizo",
  "age": 2,
  "weight": 8.5,
  "disease": null,
  "photoUrl": null
}

### Crear con dueño inexistente → 404
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Sin Dueno",
  "ownerId": 99999,
  "species": "CAT",
  "breed": "Mestizo",
  "age": 1,
  "weight": 3.0
}

### Crear inválido (validación) → 400 + errors{}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "ownerId": null,
  "species": "DOG",
  "breed": "",
  "age": -1,
  "weight": -2.0
}

### Especie inválida → 400 (cuerpo mal formado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Ave",
  "ownerId": 1,
  "species": "BIRD",
  "breed": "Mestizo",
  "age": 1,
  "weight": 1.0
}

### Actualizar (reasignar dueño) → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Buddy",
  "ownerId": 2,
  "species": "DOG",
  "breed": "Golden Retriever",
  "age": 3,
  "weight": 15.0
}

### Activar/desactivar → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/active?active=false
Accept: application/json

### Mascotas de un dueño → 200 (404 si el dueño no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/owners/1/pets
Accept: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### REST · /api/veterinarians
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar veterinarios → 200 [VeterinarianResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians
Accept: application/json

### Detalle de veterinario → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians/1
Accept: application/json

### Detalle inexistente → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians/99999
Accept: application/json

### Crear veterinario → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "102345284",
  "name": "Dra. Laura Gómez",
  "email": "laura.gomez@pethaven.com",
  "password": "vet12345",
  "specialty": "Cuidados Críticos",
  "photoUrl": "https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg"
}

### Crear duplicado (documento o correo) → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "102345284",
  "name": "Otro Veterinario",
  "email": "otro.vet@pethaven.com",
  "password": "vet12345",
  "specialty": "Cirugía"
}

### Crear inválido → 400 + errors{}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "",
  "name": "",
  "email": "no-es-un-correo",
  "password": "123",
  "specialty": ""
}

### Actualizar sin password (se conserva) → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "document": "328146627",
  "name": "Dra. Valentina Soler",
  "email": "valentina.soler@pethaven.com",
  "specialty": "Cuidados Críticos",
  "photoUrl": "https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/women/44.jpg"
}

### Activar/desactivar → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians/1/active?active=false
Accept: application/json

### DELETE no existe en la API → 405
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians/1

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### REST · /api/drugs
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar medicamentos → 200 [DrugResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs
Accept: application/json

### Listar solo medicamentos con stock → 200 [DrugResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs?available=true
Accept: application/json

### Detalle de medicamento → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/1
Accept: application/json

### Detalle inexistente → 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/99999
Accept: application/json

### Crear medicamento → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Vitamina B12 Inyectable",
  "purchasePrice": 5000.00,
  "salePrice": 9500.00,
  "unitsAvailable": 50
}

### Crear duplicado (mismo nombre) → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Vitamina B12 Inyectable",
  "purchasePrice": 5000.00,
  "salePrice": 9500.00,
  "unitsAvailable": 10
}

### Crear inválido → 400 + errors{}
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "purchasePrice": -1,
  "salePrice": null,
  "unitsAvailable": -5
}

### Importar medicamentos desde Excel → 200 DrugImportSummaryResponse
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="medicamentos.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./medicamentos.xlsx
--WebAppBoundary--

### Actualizar (unitsSold en el body se ignora) → 200
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Amoxicilina 250mg",
  "purchasePrice": 8500.00,
  "salePrice": 16000.00,
  "unitsAvailable": 190,
  "unitsSold": 999
}

### Eliminar medicamento → 204 (o 409 si está asociado a tratamientos)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/drugs/1

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### REST · /api/treatments
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Listar tratamientos → 200 [TreatmentResponse]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Accept: application/json

### Detalle de tratamiento → 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments/1
Accept: application/json

### Crear tratamiento (fecha por defecto) → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1
}

### Crear tratamiento con medicamentos (atómico) → 201 + Location
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "drugs": [
    { "drugId": 10, "units": 1 },
    { "drugId": 11, "units": 1 }
  ]
}

### Crear con fecha futura → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "petId": 1,
  "veterinarianId": 1,
  "date": "2030-01-01T10:00:00"
}

### Medicamentos del tratamiento → 200 (404 si el tratamiento no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments/1/drugs
Accept: application/json

### Administrar medicamento → 201 (sin Location)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments/1/drugs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "drugId": 5,
  "units": 2
}

### Administrar duplicado → 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/treatments/1/drugs
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "drugId": 5,
  "units": 1
}

### Historial de una mascota → 200 (404 si no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/pets/1/treatments
Accept: application/json

### Mascotas atendidas por un veterinario → 200 (404 si no existe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/veterinarians/1/treatments
Accept: application/json

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### REST · /api/auth
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════

### Login de dueño → 200 AuthResponse (role OWNER)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/owners/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login de dueño con password mala → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/owners/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "mala"
}

### Login de dueño con email desconocido → 401 (mismo mensaje, sin enumerar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/owners/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "noexiste@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login de veterinario → 200 AuthResponse (role VETERINARIAN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/veterinarians/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "valentina.soler@pethaven.com",
  "password": "vet12345"
}

### Login de veterinario con password mala → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/veterinarians/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "valentina.soler@pethaven.com",
  "password": "mala"
}

### Login de veterinario desactivado → 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/veterinarians/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "julian.restrepo@pethaven.com",
  "password": "vet12345"
}
